  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UVGJGyqbv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/993245467162972220?color=blue&label=Discord&style=plastic&logo=discord\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/exlinegames/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Curseforge-Projects-blue?style=plastic&logo=curseforge\" width=\"226\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fexline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Profle-blue?style=plastic&logo=modrinth\" width=\"185\" height=\"28\"></a></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>Деревянная броня для лошади<br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Этот мод добавляет деревянную броню для лошадей!<br>Все виды древесины можно использовать для создания различных доспехов.<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Также для создания брони для лошадей можно использовать камень.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">Скачивания</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/408/905/forgeicon.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Версии для Forge -<span style=\"color:#00f\"> <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooden-horse-armor/files/3776908\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.2</a>, <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooden-horse-armor/files/3555570\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">1.</span>18</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooden-horse-armor/files/3429688\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.17.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooden-horse-armor/files/3388240\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.16.5</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/408/904/fabricicon.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Версии для Fabric - <span style=\"color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooden-horse-armor/files/4522024\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.4</a>, <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooden-horse-armor/files/3823456\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">1.1</span>9</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooden-horse-armor/files/3775628\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.2</a>, <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooden-horse-armor/files/3555569\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">1.18</span></a>, </span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/413/663/woodhorsearmorrecipes.gif\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jexline/images/main/horizontal_line.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fexlinemods.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img1.wsimg.co